BTW, I’ve implemented this enhancement <https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/93>. Therefore, with the next release, you’ll be able to do this:

triage <- trajectory("Patient's path") %>%
  log_("arrive at queue"

) %>%
  batch(Inf, timeout=function() rgamma(1, shape = 2, rate = 0.1)) %>%
  separate() %>%
  log_("triage")
  # etc.

env <- simmer()  %>%
  add_generator("person", triage, function() rpois(1, 2)) %>%
  run(25)

Regards,
Iñaki
​

