Hi Franz, all,

Thanks to Kevin Ushey, we finally found the bug <https://github.com/tidyverse/magrittr/issues/146> in magrittr that prevents object destruction (and therefore, memory deallocation) in simmer. I don't expect a new release on CRAN solving this any time soon (note that the last magrittr release dates back to 2014), so I've implemented a workaround in simmer.

With the current master branch, you don't need to reset the environment explicitly anymore. Your code should work now with no memory issues.

Regards,
Iñaki

