Subject: Re: [simmer-devel] problems with select()
Message-ID: <bvvf933o5lM.H1Kh6kHzCQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <bvvf933o5lM.-UZnWgu1BQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
References: <bvvf933o5lM.-UZnWgu1BQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
